DESCRIPTION:This is a closed meeting of the Trinity <b>Compassion\, Peace a
 nd Reconciliation Commission's <i>Racial Justice Task Force</i></b>. For mo
 re information\, or to join this task force or any of the others listed bel
 ow\, please Jack Bussert at <a href="mailto:jhcalion2@gmail.com" target="_b
 lank"><u>jhcalion2@gmail.com</u></a>.<br>CPR is an umbrella commission that
  coordinates and supports the social justice work undertaken by its subcomm
 ittees and task forces. In 2023\, these included: Racial Justice\, Reproduc
 tive Freedom\, Mental Health\, Gun Violence\, and Social Dialogue. Most mee
 tings are open to interested parishioners.
