DESCRIPTION:<br>Sacred Stitchery is open to both men and women who enjoy ne
 edle crafts such as knitting\, crocheting\, quilting and embroidery. Trinit
 y’s Sacred Stitchery meets on the <strong>2nd Thursdays</strong> of most mo
 nths from <strong>10:00 am –</strong> <strong>11:00 am</strong> at Panera B
 read. Participants work on their own personal projects\; or they make and b
 less prayer shawls for parishioners who are ill or recovering from surgery 
 or bereaved and also baby blankets for infants born into the Trinity commun
 ity. For more information contact Margie Taylor at <a href="mailto:mjtaylor
 _3@hotmail.com">mjtaylor_3@hotmail.com</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260710T132221Z
LOCATION:Panera Bread\, 2748 E 3rd St\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sacred Stitchery
TRANSP:OPAQUE
